---

This repository contains the Apache 2.0-licensed Tier 1 surface of
IntentProof as defined in plan-intentproof/decisions/ADR-010-licensing-and-ip-strategy.md:

    - cmd/intentproof-verify  (offline verifier binary)
    - cmd/intentproof         (developer CLI)
    - pkg/verifier            (policy evaluator)
    - pkg/bundle              (.proof.tar.zst export/extract)
    - pkg/policy              (YAML compiler, canonical JSON, diff)
    - pkg/crypto              (policy signer / verifier abstractions)
    - pkg/attestation         (adapter SDK interface, helpers)

The operational data plane (ingest, outbox publisher, flow builder,
attestation gateway, query API, certificate issuer, and other
"cmd/*" services) lives in github.com/intentproof/intentproof-core
under the Business Source License 1.1 with a 4-year conversion to
Apache 2.0. That repository may depend on this one. This repository
must not depend on that one.
